hmmm, modus operandi: if it exists, destroy it!

try a rational approach ... a sacred place is a place for religious
rituals ... a human priest/ess in a sacred place could conceivably
have a "good connection" to the gods ... the priest/ess is not
attacking you so perhaps #chatting is not a bad idea (but don't
expect to be rewarded for making the attempt). on the other hand
attacking a priest/ess in his/her temple seems foolhardy.

